    <p class="small" style="margin-top:auto">Source: Our World in Data (vaccination) | Deck scope: historical trajectory, impact evidence, and remaining gaps</p>
  </div></section>

  <section class="slide"><div class="content">
    <h2>From 100 Years to Under 1 Year: Vaccine Development Is Accelerating</h2>
    <p class="small">Gap between pathogen identification and vaccine licensure (years)</p>
    <div class="bar-wrap">
      <div class="bar"><div class="label">Typhoid fever</div><div class="track"><div class="fill" style="width:100%"></div></div><div class="val">105</div></div>
      <div class="bar"><div class="label">Meningitis</div><div class="track"><div class="fill" style="width:87.6%"></div></div><div class="val">92</div></div>
      <div class="bar"><div class="label">Polio</div><div class="track"><div class="fill" style="width:44.8%"></div></div><div class="val">47</div></div>
      <div class="bar"><div class="label">Measles</div><div class="track"><div class="fill" style="width:9.5%"></div></div><div class="val">10</div></div>
      <div class="bar"><div class="label">Hepatitis B</div><div class="track"><div class="fill" style="width:15.2%"></div></div><div class="val">16</div></div>
      <div class="bar"><div class="label">COVID-19</div><div class="track"><div class="fill covid" style="width:1%"></div></div><div class="val">&lt;1</div></div>
    </div>
    <p class="small" style="margin-top:auto">Modern microscopy, genome sequencing, mRNA platforms, and virus-like particles enabled rapid design cycles.</p>
  </div></section>

  <section class="slide"><div class="content">
    <h2>100% Case Reduction Achieved for Diphtheria, Polio, and Smallpox in the US</h2>
    <table>
      <thead><tr><th>Disease</th><th>Pre-vaccine cases /M/yr</th><th>Post-vaccine cases /M/yr</th><th>Case reduction</th><th>Pre-vaccine deaths /M/yr</th><th>Death reduction</th></tr></thead>
