      <div class="anno" style="left:47%">1971: MMR introduced</div>
      <div class="anno" style="left:60%">1980: Kindergarten mandate</div>
    </div>
    <p class="small" style="margin-top:auto">Before 1963, most states reported 100–1,000+ cases per 100,000. After the 1980 mandate, incidence fell to near zero with sporadic outbreaks.</p>
  </div></section>

